    "body": "I can reproduce this by unsetting the upstream:\r\n```\r\ngit branch --unset-upstream \r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever explicitly setting the upstream reference make the `remote_name` and `remote_branch` visible in the prompt.\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit branch --set-upstream-to origin/main\r\n```",
